# 🌱 Agritech – AI-Powered Smart Agriculture Assistant

Agritech is an AI-powered web application that helps farmers identify crop diseases from leaf images and access agricultural resources through intelligent services such as multilingual support, market price information, government schemes, and an AI chatbot. The platform combines Machine Learning, Deep Learning, and Web Technologies to provide an accessible digital farming assistant.

---

## Features

- 🌿 AI-powered crop disease detection from leaf images
- 🤖 Intelligent agriculture chatbot for farmer assistance
- 🌍 Multilingual user interface with translation support
- 📈 Crop market price information
- 🏛 Government schemes and subsidy recommendations
- 🔐 Secure OTP-based authentication using JWT
- 📊 Disease detection history for authenticated users
- 💬 User feedback and activity tracking

---

